            "detailed_description": "Constant sensation of ultimate speed is the players companion throughout the game. Lightning-fast reflexes and tactical skills are what stands between victory and defeat.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tBreakneck rides on near vertical mountainsides with up to 70-degree slopes - feel your heart pumping!<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tExtreme track design with breathtaking vistas - learning the inside-outs of their topography will be an advantage in the race for #1.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tSteer your vehicle mid air allowing for full control over your ride. Shortening or lengthening your jumps, changing angles can make or break your lap time.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tAssemble your own vehicles from a wide selection of parts and components. Adjust their parameters to best suit your playing style and personalize the looks, making it unique and truly your own.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different classes compete simultaneously on the same track<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  </li><li>Unique original soundtrack that brings across the vibe of the game, from members renowned bands such as Deftones, Fear Factory, Hatebreed or Static X, created specifically for nail'd<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  </li><li>14 unforgettable tracks in 4 exciting locations<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
