                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "91% very positive eh? No thanks. The vehicles feel absolutely weightless. I understand that a game like ATV Offroad Fury, Motorstorm, or Pure are arcade like but this takes that meaning to an entire new level. At least other ATV/UTV games have the fundamental mechanics of driving in a \"physics based arcade\" - this is just absolute arcade through in through. Where are even the *semblance* of physics? \n\nIf that's your style then by all means, but I would recommend PURE every single day of the week over this. Good lord.",
